   "source": [
    "# TransRefNet — Google Colab Training Notebook\n",
    "\n",
    "**TransRefNet: Transformer-Augmented Refinement Network for Biomedical Image Segmentation**\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook trains and evaluates TransRefNet and the ConvSegNet baseline on four biomedical segmentation datasets:\n",
    "- **Kvasir-SEG** — polyp segmentation (1 000 images)\n",
    "- **CVC-ClinicDB** — polyp segmentation (612 images)\n",
    "- **ISIC 2018 Task 1** — skin lesion segmentation (2 594 images)\n",
    "- **DSB 2018** — nucleus segmentation (~670 samples)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Before running:** Runtime → Change runtime type → **T4 GPU**\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "### Notebook Sections\n",
    "0. GPU check\n",
    "1. Mount Google Drive\n",
    "2. Clone repo & install dependencies\n",
    "3. Kaggle credentials setup\n",
    "4. Download datasets\n",
    "5. DSB 2018 mask preprocessing *(run once)*\n",
    "6. Train — TransRefNet\n",
    "7. Train — ConvSegNet baseline\n",
    "8. Evaluate all checkpoints\n",
    "9. Results summary table"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
